.git
.local
.venv
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
__pycache__
*.pyc

web/node_modules
web/dist

# Neither crate is built or installed by this Dockerfile -- cryo_native is an optional
# PyO3 extension cryo/engines/native/engine.py imports defensively (falls back to the
# Go engine if unavailable), never compiled into this image; cryo-engine is the
# separately-built Rust engine. Excluding both wholesale, not just */target, keeps
# their own CVEs (e.g. Cargo.lock's pyo3 advisory, confirmed live 2026-10-12: Trivy
# flagged cryo-native/Cargo.lock inside this image despite nothing in it ever running)
# out of a scan that should only cover what this image actually executes.
cryo-native
cryo-engine

deploy/helm/cryo/values-*.yaml
docs/_private
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
